                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On December 27, 1949, the United States announced that talks would open with Cuba
                    in February 1950 for renegotiation under the GATT of Cuban concessions on
                    certain items negotiated originally in 1947; see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, January 9, 1950, page 58. For information
                    on the results of the renegotiations which concluded on May 31, 1950, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, June 12, 1950, page 980.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
